meta {
  name: hiu
  seq: 11
}

docs {
  M3 as HIU (ADR-014): ask a patient for permission to read the records other facilities hold,
  and read what they push. Set `patientId` and `facilityId`. Every route needs
  `can_view_clinical_data` for the patient.

  The answers arrive as callbacks (folder `callbacks`, requests 16 to 21). The GET updates by
  itself in the MFE; here, send it again.
}
